• providers/runtime/php.sh (replacing InstallPHPBase.sh with Ondřej Surý's PPA + nala extension installs)
• Legacy compatibility shims (replacing InstallWebserver.sh, InstallDatastoreTools.sh, etc., with 2-line wrappers so existing ADT callers work untouched)
• Build-on-node providers for Apache & Lighttpd (providers/webserver/apache.sh and lighttpd.sh)
